A few thoughts on 3.1.3, along with a few possible spoilers...



While I kinda think the idea that monsters can use wands and potions
and weapons is neat, the above example pushes it just a bit.  Level 6
or 7 or so in the DOD, my barbarian, who had just lost his plate mail
and cloak (along with about 8 ac points) to a polymorph trap, ran into
3 or 4 stone giants.  Ok, no problem, me and my battleaxe'll just start
hacking away as they come through the hallway.  Take 2 out, hack on
the third, and he reads a scroll of teleportation!  Meanwhile, his 2
other brothers turn round and head back down the hall.  "Beautiful!
Now I can rest a few, start getting my strength up, etc..."  So I
chomp on the corpse the first giant left me, start down the hall, and
get:

You are hit by a death ray! --More--
You die... --More--

Ok, a teleport scroll, I can see... but come on...  a wand of death?
yeesh...  

